{"id":"5e2886eda40b8b0a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-branching-program.md","title":"分层有限宽度分支程序","display":"df-branching-program — 分层有限宽度分支程序","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-branching-program","aliases":["28-df-branching-program"],"display":"df-branching-program — 分层有限宽度分支程序","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§21.6 configuration-graph computation","source_printed_pages":"449–450","source_pdf_pages":"475–476","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-branching-program"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-branching-program</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-branching-program — 分层有限宽度分支程序"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.6 configuration-graph computation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"449–450"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"475–476"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(w,T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in[w]\">\\(s\\in[w]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[w]\">\\(A\\subseteq[w]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]\">\\(\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le t&lt;T\">\\(0\\le t&lt;T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t&lt;T})\">\\(B=(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t&lt;T})\\)</span>；输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_T)\\in\\{0,1\\}^T\">\\(r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_T)\\in\\{0,1\\}^T\\)</span>，坐标编号从 1 到 T。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_A\">\\(\\mathbf1_A\\)</span> 为集合指示函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_0^B(r)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad q_{t+1}^B(r)\\coloneqq\\delta_t(q_t^B(r),r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\le t&lt;T),\\qquad B(r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_A(q_T^B(r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_0^B(r)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad q_{t+1}^B(r)\\coloneqq\\delta_t(q_t^B(r),r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\le t&lt;T),\\qquad B(r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_A(q_T^B(r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\coloneqq\\{(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t&lt;T}):s\\in[w]\\land A\\subseteq[w]\\land\\forall t&lt;T\\;\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\coloneqq\\{(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t&lt;T}):s\\in[w]\\land A\\subseteq[w]\\land\\forall t&lt;T\\;\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将原书空间受限配置图按时间展开的显式接口：每步只读一次向前随机比特，状态集宽度 w，长度 T；不允许随机带双向重读。递归按 t 有限展开而唯一。这是模型实现约定，不把本项误记为原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.6 configuration-graph computation；印刷页 449–450；PDF 页 475–476。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"w,T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in[w]","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[w]","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le t<T","display":false},{"tex":"B=(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t<T})","display":false},{"tex":"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_T)\\in\\{0,1\\}^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_A","display":false},{"tex":"q_0^B(r)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad q_{t+1}^B(r)\\coloneqq\\delta_t(q_t^B(r),r_{t+1})\\quad(0\\le t<T),\\qquad B(r)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_A(q_T^B(r)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}\\coloneqq\\{(w,T,s,A,(\\delta_t)_{t<T}):s\\in[w]\\land A\\subseteq[w]\\land\\forall t<T\\;\\delta_t:[w]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\to[w]\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1632,"backlinks":[{"id":"c35eaa9794525bdd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$w,T,s\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\epsilon\\in[0,1]$，$G:\\{0,1\\}^s\\to\\{0,1\\}^T$。$\\mathsf{BP}_{w,T}$ 与 $B(r)$ 见 [[28-df-branching-program]]；$U_j$ 表示 j 个独立公平比特。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-391","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}